        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, long-distance train</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, long-distance train
The data is based on the bulk material composition of the IC 2000, a state of the art Swiss train composition.  The life span of the lis assumed to be 40 years resulting in a life time performance of 20 Mio. vkm ;
UUID: c76e1273-d1ca-4c50-bbc6-295a976b063a
The inventory includes waste treatment processes for non metal components of a IC 2000 train composition. For the transport of disposed materials standard distances have been applied.
Location: Data represents Swiss disposal conditions
Technology: no technologies are specified
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data based on the material composition of an IC 2000. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c76e1273-d1ca-4c50-bbc6-295a976b063a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
